[[Unidentified Amulet]] is a rare item available in the shop for all characters. After buying '''Unidentified Amulet''', it instantly transforms into one of the nine possible amulets: [[Amulet of Life]], [[Amulet of Steel]], [[Amulet of Feasting]], [[Amulet of Energy]], [[Amulet of the Wild]], [[Amulet of Alchemy]], [[Amulet of Darkness]], [[Amulet of Fortune]], or [[Amulet of Light]]. In general, these Amulets are build-defining and powerful for 1 tile items.

